WEBVTT

00:14:28.526 --> 00:14:31.494
but it was me optimized now
for this ecosystem.

00:14:32.431 --> 00:14:36.391
And as it turns out,
I did a really good job.

00:14:37.134 --> 00:14:40.166
I was the most popular person online.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.685
(Laughter)

00:14:42.709 --> 00:14:46.899
(Applause)

00:14:46.923 --> 00:14:50.386
And as it turns out, lots and lots
of men wanted to date me.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.211
So I call my mom, I call my sister,
I call my grandmother.

00:14:53.235 --> 00:14:55.364
I'm telling them about this fabulous news,

00:14:55.388 --> 00:14:58.617
and they say, "This is wonderful!
How soon are you going out?"

00:14:58.641 --> 00:15:01.323
I said, "Actually, I'm not going
to go out with anybody."